OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1770122807
OL,3,CFootball team win 30-0 to keep
OL,4,C'perfect' season dream alive
OL,6,FJersey Bulls Women have continued
OL,7,Ftheir 'perfect' league season, after a
OL,8,Fclub record 30-0 win at bottom side
OL,9,FGuildford Saints Women.
OL,11,FThe result means that Bulls have won
OL,12,Fall 11 of their matches in the South
OL,13,FEast Counties Women's League Surrey
OL,14,FDivision One and sit top of the table,
OL,15,Fhaving scored 95 goals and conceded
OL,16,Fjust eight.
OL,18,FOn Sunday, Anita Tavares continued her
OL,19,Fred-hot form with a triple hat-trick,
OL,20,Fleaving her with 28 goals and 22
OL,21,Fassists so far this campaign.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/2
