OL,3,CFootball team win 30-0 to keep
OL,4,C'perfect' season dream alive
OL,6,FBulls shared their delight on social
OL,7,Fmedia, describing it as "a dominant
OL,8,Fteam performance with every outfield
OL,9,Fplayer getting on the scoresheet".
OL,11,FThey are yet to lose a league game in
OL,12,Ftheir history, having only been
OL,13,Ffounded last summer - seven years
OL,14,Fafter the men's team was formed.
